WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:05.150
Speaker 1: . Hey, David, with all of the talk
of vaccine passports, I'm wondering, is a

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.510
vaccine passport even really a controversial
thing?

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:10.769
So, no, the answer is no.

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:15.869
I mean, listen, the term vaccine passport
is now being used.

00:00:15.869 --> 00:00:21.180
But what we're really talking about is to
do certain things.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.859
Vaccination has been required for a very long
time.

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:28.230
We're now talking about adding an additional
vaccination.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:32.250
But let's break it down to travel to other
countries.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.329
There have been vaccination requirements for
decades.

00:00:35.329 --> 00:00:40.410
There are countries in South America and in
Africa where you need a yellow fever vaccine

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.410
to go.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:46.469
You need to show proof of yellow fever vaccination
to go to Saudi Arabia.

00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:49.680
I don't know if it's at any time or during
the Hajj.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.980
You need to show proof of a meningococcal
vaccine.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:55.980
There's a list.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.410
Just look at mandatory vaccine travel requirements.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:03.910
So there's really no difference in another
country saying.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:11.040
Imagine France, there's two things France
might do, France could say everybody who lives

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.570
in France must be vaccinated.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.610
That would be government forcing a vaccination
on people.

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:21.910
That's not going to happen, France could say,
to travel here from another country, non French,

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.430
anybody who's not who doesn't have a citizenship.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:25.430
Right.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:26.460
To be in France.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:27.640
We require the covid-19 vaccine.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.370
They could do that.

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.610
That wouldn't be new.

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:31.650
That wouldn't be controversial.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.170
It would only be new as it applies specifically
to the coronavirus vaccine.

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:39.760
We are seeing more and more colleges say to
be on campus in the fall.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.290
Students will have to be vaccinated.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:43.290
This is not new.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.290
This is not controversial.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:51.550
Don Jr has been tweeting about this as if
it's some kind of dystopian communist authoritarian

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:52.550
nightmare.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:53.550
I know it makes no sense.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.280
His kids go to schools that require certain
vaccinations.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:01.710
And what some schools are doing is they are
choosing what is the list of required vaccinations

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:02.900
to come to this school.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:05.470
You don't have to go to that school now.

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:11.170
Let's get to so now that we realize that what
we're talking about is actually not new or

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:17.120
particularly controversial, let's go to what
is being sometimes implied by the term vaccine

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:20.010
passport.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:24.109
One thing that's being implied is the U.S.
government will require you to have a vaccine.

00:02:24.109 --> 00:02:27.400
It's not going to happen, just not going to
happen.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.959
And it's a straw man.

00:02:28.959 --> 00:02:32.859
This is sort of like when someone says, hey,
let's do universal background checks and the

00:02:32.859 --> 00:02:37.069
right says they're coming for the Second Amendment,
they're going to get rid of the Second Amendment.

00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:39.000
No, that's not what's happening now.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.409
It's not what's happening at all.

00:02:40.409 --> 00:02:43.010
There is not going to be mandatory U.S. government.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.860
I can't speak for every other country.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.560
There may be some other authoritarian countries
that will mandate covid vaccination.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:52.110
The U.S. is not going to mandate covid vaccination.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:59.390
What you what you may see is different businesses
say we will require vaccination.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:04.590
If you want to do business with us at a certain
point, you may see an airline say we are beyond

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.580
the period of requiring a test.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:07.580
At this point.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.099
If you want to fly with us, you need a vaccine.

00:03:10.099 --> 00:03:16.659
You may see certain sports teams or leagues
say if you want to come after a certain date,

00:03:16.659 --> 00:03:20.159
we're going to wait until the vaccine has
been open to everyone for three months after

00:03:20.159 --> 00:03:24.109
that point, which would be, I guess, July
19th.

00:03:24.109 --> 00:03:27.379
If you want to come to a game at our stadium,
you need to be vaccinated.

00:03:27.379 --> 00:03:32.159
I don't think it will be super common, but
that would be completely within the rights

00:03:32.159 --> 00:03:35.340
of businesses to do.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:38.909
And a lot of the right wingers opposing that
are the same people that for twenty years

00:03:38.909 --> 00:03:42.290
or 10 years or five years have been saying
businesses should be able to do whatever they

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:43.409
want as long as it's not illegal.

00:03:43.409 --> 00:03:45.639
It's not illegal to require vaccine.

00:03:45.639 --> 00:03:50.779
They will also there's another talking point
floating around, which is they are violating

00:03:50.779 --> 00:03:56.049
Hypatia because they are requiring you to
share medical information.

00:03:56.049 --> 00:04:00.139
This is a completely ridiculous interpretation
of what hip hop is.

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:03.219
Hipper is something that medical professionals
are bound by.

00:04:03.219 --> 00:04:06.189
The business isn't forcing you to reveal.

00:04:06.189 --> 00:04:12.499
First of all, hip doesn't apply because it's
you, not a doctor's office that would be sharing

00:04:12.499 --> 00:04:14.359
vaccination information.

00:04:14.359 --> 00:04:17.690
Number two, you're not even being required
to do it.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:24.770
It's here is what we require if you, as a
participant in the market, choose to do business

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:25.910
with us.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.180
Terrible, terrible argument.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:31.630
Now, are there arguments against vaccine requirements
generally?

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.380
This isn't just about covid.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.950
Sure, sure.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:43.811
You know, if you have a situation where there's
really inequitable access to a vaccine, you

00:04:43.811 --> 00:04:48.820
could have a situation where what you are
saying is the poor part of the world can't

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:53.850
come to our country if we put in a vaccine
mandate.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.970
And that's something that you could deal with
a friend.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:05:02.320
Imagine in the imaginary friends vaccine mandate,
France might say.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:08.750
To come to our country, if you're not a French
national, of course, if you are in a country.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:13.510
Where X percent of the population has already
been vaccinated, then you need a vaccine,

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:18.350
we will offer a test and quarantine exemption
for people from countries that have not yet

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:19.790
reached 50 percent.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.790
You could figure that out.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:21.980
That's something that you could figure out.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:26.850
What about people who can't get the vaccine
because of a condition that they have where

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:28.690
they are not able to get vaccinated?

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:33.270
OK, that that's a now we're talking about
a practical issue that we can deal with.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:38.220
Can you get a medical exemption from a vaccine
requirement that's also not new?

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:40.800
That's something that's been around for a
very long time.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:47.310
What countries can choose not to offer, though,
are exemptions for so-called religious beliefs,

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:50.060
and that would be up to each, each and every
country to decide.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:55.720
So long story short, vaccine requirements
for travel, not new vaccine requirements for

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:58.830
schools, not new.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:02.270
The government of the U.S. is not going to
force people to be vaccinated.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:06.120
And beyond that, we're talking about people
participating in markets don't like the rule

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.510
that a business has.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.510
Don't do business with them.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:07:43.430
No problem whatsoever.

